--[[
    Tower Defense UI (WindUI) - front-end for td_api.lua
    Host BOTH files (td_api.lua + td_ui.lua), put their raw URLs below, then run:

        loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YOU/REPO/main/td_ui.lua"))()

    This script loads the API itself and re-queues ITSELF with queue_on_teleport,
    so the UI + API + auto-run chain comes back after every teleport.

    New: "Safety" tab -> auto-replace destroyed towers + place/upgrade delays.
]]

